# Invariant ignores shared across every project in this repo - OS/editor churn and generic
# build-tool caches that look the same regardless of which project produced them. Project-specific
# output paths (APK layout, wails' build/bin, this app's own data/archive dirs, etc.) stay in that
# project's own .gitignore instead - only move a pattern here if it would apply unchanged in any
# project of that general kind (any JVM project, any project touched on a Mac, etc.).
#
# panopticon/ itself isn't a git repo - phone-app/ and controller/ are separate ones. This file
# only takes effect for them because each has `git config core.excludesFile ../.gitignore` set
# locally (see each project's README). That setting lives in .git/config, isn't itself versioned,
# and needs to be re-run once after a fresh clone of either child repo.

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors / IDEs
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo

# Java / Gradle (Android today, any future JVM tooling)
.gradle/
*.class

# Native build caches (Android NDK / CMake)
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/

# Node/npm-based frontend tooling
node_modules/

# Generic
*.log
